  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This partnership with GiZ and the Addis Ababa Solid Waste Management Agency aims at improving plastic waste collection, through the design and provision of manual plastic baling machines. These machines will enable waste collecting associations and informal groups better package plastic waste and will increase income from the sale of the waste plastic by an estimated 40%.</narrative>
